-- Row il-70. EXPECTED RED: four assertions that fail on purpose. Each says that a section named in the list is not repealed by an instrument deposited here, and each is FALSE.
-- I1 (section 29C): section 128, section 170 and section 171 of the Customs Ordinance are each repealed by an instrument deposited here (SH 1533 item 17; SH 1533 item 21(2) of the Customs Agents (Amendment) Law), and the 1995 instruction on the list leaves all three in it. Three assertions fail.
-- I2 (section 29D): section 144A of the Value Added Tax Law is repealed by an instrument deposited here (SH 1497 paragraph (15) of item 11), and the 1987, 2002 and 2014 instructions on the list leave it in. One assertion fails.
-- The count, four, is declared in check.sh (expected_failed) and in encoding.json (expected_red). If a later instrument removes a number from a list, its assertion turns green and the declared count must go down with it.

